1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,460
The colony is a caste society.

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:08,072
One queen, the only fertile female, laying up to two thousand eggs a day.

3
00:00:08,072 --> 00:00:15,351
Thousands of sterile female workers, who clean, nurse, build, guard and finally forage.

4
00:00:15,351 --> 00:00:21,250
And a few hundred drones, males that hatch from unfertilised eggs, so they are haploid.

5
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:22,369
What makes a queen?

6
00:00:22,369 --> 00:00:23,203
Diet.

7
00:00:23,203 --> 00:00:29,635
Every larva gets royal jelly for about three days, but only the future queen is kept on it.

